<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Unohtumaton ilta (Georg Ost and others)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1958</span><span class="sg-chain-h">Finnish version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Midnight in Moscow (New Orleans Syncopators, arranged by Jan Burgers)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1961</span><span class="sg-chain-h">jazz arrangement</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Midnight in Moscow (Kenny Ball and his Jazzmen)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1961</span><span class="sg-chain-h">jazz arrangement (Burgers's)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Mezzanotte a Mosca (Italian choirs)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">after 1964</span><span class="sg-chain-h">Italian version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Kvällar i Moskvas förstäder (Jan Johansson, Jazz på ryska)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1967</span><span class="sg-chain-h">jazz version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Evenings in Suburban Moscow (Gao Ping, Soviet Love Songs for Vocalising Pianist)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2003</span><span class="sg-chain-h">adapted as</span></li></ul></section>
